<PageTitle>Datasets: DbnSuite</PageTitle>

<h1>Datasets</h1>
<p class="lead">
    DbnSuite archives and reads every Databento® dataset the same way. What differs from one dataset to the next is
    written down in a dataset profile, and a dataset without a profile is not supported.
</p>

